<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila Mining 96 net at 28.163 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Manila Mining 96 net at 28.163 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Manila Mining Corp posted a net income of 28.163 million pesos for the year 1996, documents submitted to the Philippine Stock Exchange on Friday showed.</p>
<p>Revenues from its operations totalled 727.832 million pesos, while costs and expenses reached 685.591 million pesos.</p>
<p>No comparative figures were immediately provided by one of the country's biggest gold producers.</p>
<p>Figures available with Reuters show that the company's audited net profit in 1995 was 349.6 million pesos.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
